# Package manager

This repo uses **pnpm** (`pnpm-lock.yaml`).

When suggesting install/scripts, use:

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm add <pkg>
pnpm add -D <pkg>
pnpm run <script>
```

Do not suggest `npm install` / `yarn` unless the user explicitly asks. Still **do not run** the command — show it and wait for ✅ (manual-commands-only).
